below threshold: repeated transfers never register: true
disabled (min_bytes = 0): large repeated transfers never register: true
kept control: live host array survives collection rounds: true
above threshold: registers on second transfer and stays idempotent on third: true
dropped registered array: registered on second sighting, reclaimed and unregistered once: true
dropped once-seen array: never registered and never unregistered: true
live array remains registered after unrelated drops: true
declined registration: not retried on third transfer and never unregistered on drop: true
unregister exception in finaliser: swallowed, counted as failure, live_bytes cleared: true
finaliser reentrancy during register: no deadlock, dead entry unregistered once: true
unregister_all: releases live entries immediately: true
unregister_all followed by GC: finaliser does not double-unregister: true
dynamic disable after registration: already-pinned array stays true, new arrays stay false: true
